      "title": "GLENMARK: US Respiratory And Allergy Approvals Will Drive Future Upside",
      "body": "Narrative Update: Glenmark Pharmaceuticals Analyst Price Target The analyst price target for Glenmark Pharmaceuticals is kept at ₹2,735, with analysts citing updated assumptions for revenue growth at 7.13%, profit margin at 19.60%, and a future P/E of 27.61 as key inputs in their refreshed model. What's in the News BlinkRx added access to RYALTRIS Nasal Spray for seasonal allergic rhinitis patients in the US, following Glenmark Pharmaceuticals Inc., USA’s shift to direct commercialization and distribution.",
