      "title": "GLENMARK: Future US Respiratory Launches Will Still Leave Earnings At Risk",
      "body": "Analysts have fine tuned their outlook on Glenmark Pharmaceuticals, with the updated price target now set around ₹1,532. This reflects adjustments to assumptions on revenue growth, profit margins and forward P/E that they view as better aligned with the current fundamentals.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nse-glenmark/glenmark-pharmaceuticals-shares/a1g4fbar-global-regulatory-burdens-will-hamper-legacy-generic-business-4pxa/updates/6-analysts-have-fine-tuned-their-outlook-on-glenmark-pharmaceu",
