      "date": "2026-04-15T03:11:43.000Z",
      "title": "GLENMARK: Future US Respiratory Approvals Will Not Offset Earnings Risk",
      "body": "Analysts have adjusted their fair value estimate for Glenmark Pharmaceuticals slightly lower from ₹1,555.42 to ₹1,531.86, citing updated assumptions around revenue growth, profit margins, and future P/E valuation. What's in the News Received final U.S. FDA approval for Progesterone Vaginal Inserts, 100 mg, deemed bioequivalent and therapeutically equivalent to Endometrin Vaginal Inserts, 100 mg, with the reference market showing approximately US$59.2m in annual sales for the 12 months ending February 2026 (IQVIA via company announcement).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nse-glenmark/glenmark-pharmaceuticals-shares/a1g4fbar-global-regulatory-burdens-will-hamper-legacy-generic-business-4pxa/updates/5-analysts-have-adjusted-their-fair-value-estimate-for-glenmar",
      "raw_subtype": "narrative-update"
    },
    {
      "id": "d6eb2d7f-6404-40ce-9b21-16cfa19e092f",
      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-04-09T11:30:00.000Z",
      "title": "Glenmark Pharmaceuticals Limited Receives U.S. FDA Approval for Progesterone Vaginal Inserts, 100 Mg",
      "body": "Glenmark Pharmaceuticals Limited (Glenmark) has received final approval from the United States Food & Drug Administration (U.S. FDA) for Progesterone Vaginal Inserts, 100 mg, determined by the FDA to be bioequivalent and therapeutically equivalent to the reference listed drug (RLD), Endometrin Vaginal Inserts, 100 mg of Ferring Pharmaceuticals Inc. [NDA 022057]. Glenmark's Progesterone Vaginal Inserts, 100 mg will be distributed in the U.S. by Glenmark Pharmaceuticals Inc., USA. According to IQVIA sales data for the 12-month period ending February 2026, the Endometrin Vaginal Inserts, 100 mg market achieved annual sales of approximately $59.2 million. Glenmark's Progesterone Vaginal Inserts, 100 mg is only approved for the indication(s) listed in Glenmark's approved label. Market includes ",
      "keyDevTypeId": "41",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "1bd82b35-ea35-4e2a-a6d6-7fb08024f802",
      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-04-01T02:05:29.000Z",
      "title": "GLENMARK: Future Diabetes Launches Will Not Offset Slower Revenue Trajectory",
      "body": "Analysts have nudged their fair value estimate for Glenmark Pharmaceuticals to ₹1,555 from ₹1,542, reflecting updated assumptions around a slightly lower discount rate, more conservative revenue growth and profit margin inputs, and a higher future P/E multiple. What's in the News Launch of GLIPIQ (semaglutide) in India for Type 2 diabetes, with vial and pre-filled pen formats aimed at making GLP-1 therapy more affordable and accessible after approval by the Central Drugs Standard Control Organization (CDSCO) following a Phase III study in Indian patients (Key Developments).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nse-glenmark/glenmark-pharmaceuticals-shares/a1g4fbar-global-regulatory-burdens-will-hamper-legacy-generic-business-4pxa/updates/4-analysts-have-nudged-their-fair-value-estimate-for-glenmark",
      "raw_subtype": "narrative-update"
    },
    {
      "id": "e053589a-ac7c-4396-a251-bf4599776b23",
      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-03-17T21:05:07.000Z",
      "title": "GLENMARK: Upcoming US Respiratory Launch Will Support Future Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have kept Glenmark Pharmaceuticals' fair value estimate steady at ₹2,735, reflecting slightly updated assumptions on revenue growth, profit margin, and future P/E that currently offset each other in their price target models. What's in the News Glenmark Specialty SA received final U.S. FDA approval for Fluticasone Propionate Inhalation Aerosol USP, 44 mcg per actuation, which is rated bioequivalent and therapeutically equivalent to FloVent HFA 44 mcg of GlaxoSmithKline (Product-Related Announcements).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nse-glenmark/glenmark-pharmaceuticals-shares/ouchgnfp-global-aging-and-emerging-markets-will-fuel-specialty-and-biosimilars-3lwf/updates/5-analysts-have-kept-glenmark-pharmaceuticals-fair-value-esti",
